*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% A minimal PPD for a raw-only queue: CUPS passes printpipe's TSPL to the
*% printer untouched (lp -o raw), so it describes only what lpadmin needs.
*% printpipe gives it with lpadmin -P because -m raw fails on macOS.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "XP365B.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Xprinter"
*Product: "(XP-365B)"
*ModelName: "Xprinter XP-365B"
*ShortNickName: "Xprinter XP-365B"
*NickName: "Xprinter XP-365B, raw (printpipe)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Xprinter;MDL:XP-365B;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w113h85
*PageSize w113h85/40 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[113 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w113h85
*PageRegion w113h85/40 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[113 85]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w113h85
*ImageableArea w113h85/40 x 30 mm: "0 0 113 85"
*DefaultPaperDimension: w113h85
*PaperDimension w113h85/40 x 30 mm: "113 85"
